  <div class="osw-cot-panel">
    <div class="osw-cot-label">CoT</div>
    <div class="osw-cot-text">Private key public, funds could be stolen anytime. […] We can deploy!</div>
  </div>
  <div class="osw-cot-panel osw-cot-accent">
